{#- ------------------------------------------- replicate execution detail -#}
{%- if failed_replicates.executions %}

<details><summary>Replicate execution failures ({{ failed_replicates.executions | length }})</summary>

Each experiment/variant runs multiple replicates, retried up to 8 times on a target crash or OOM kill; a replicate that exhausts its retries is marked dead and the whole experiment loses its analysis. Rows are bucketed by experiment, variant, replicate type and failure mode.

| experiment | variant | type | replicates | failure | dead | debug |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
{% for e in failed_replicates.executions -%}
| {{ e.experiment }} | {{ e.variant }} | {{ e.replicate_type }} | {{ e.replicates_display }} | {{ e.failure_display }} | {{ "yes" if e.is_dead else "retried" }} | {% if config and config.report and config.report.debug_dashboard %}[dashboard]({{ config.report.debug_dashboard | interpolate(experiment=e.experiment, variant=e.variant, replicate_type=e.replicate_type) }}){% endif %} |
{% endfor -%}
</details>
